  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Humanitarian Needs by Providing Information Management Support and Distribution of Essential Non-food Items for Displaced and Vulnerable Crisis-Affected Populations in Sudan.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM continues to address critical humanitarian needs and contribute to building resilience of the society through integrated support for displaced and vulnerable crisis-affected populations in Sudan. Focus areas of the action are coordination and common services, protection via the Displacement Tracking Matrix (DTM) to provide evidence-based information for planning and programming life-saving responses, and provision of essential non-food items to the most vulnerable people.</narrative>
  </description>
